    {
      "text": "Framework diagram (Figure 1, “Mise en œuvre de la stratégie mondiale (synthèse)”) with one colour-coded row for each strategic objective OS1–OS4 and five columns: Objectifs, Réalisations, Produits, Politiques et mesures, and Cibles d’impact, linked by arrows. The impact targets are, in order: an ever more appropriate and sustainable digital health ecosystem; cost-effective and efficient health systems and services; accelerated digitalization of the health and well-being sector; and healthier populations.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
